{"packageRef":{"id":"content.c.p05","version":"1.0.0"},"subject":{"id":"exercise.c.check-nondecreasing","version":"1.0.0","title":"相邻比较与非递减","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"lessonRef":{"id":"lesson.c.adjacent-order","version":"1.0.0"},"learningRevision":1,"acceptedPriorVersions":[],"knowledgeRefs":[{"id":"knowledge.c.arrays","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"knowledge.c.sorting","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"knowledge.c.conditions","version":"1.0.0"}],"programRef":{"id":"program.c.practice-check-nondecreasing","version":"1.0.0"},"judgeRef":{"id":"judge.c.check-nondecreasing","version":"1.0.0"},"prompt":"values长度0..30。输出1表示非递减，否则0。空或单项没有相邻对可违反要求，按定义输出1；不得为此读物理占位或越界相邻元素。\n\n教学目标：按实际相邻项比较判断有序，直到首逆序或遍历完整区间，输出依赖比较。\n\n所有测试都须正常结束且main返回0。必须让当前真实执行的数据与控制过程满足目标，不能用固定答案、死读取或未执行结构代替。","tests":[{"caseKey":"empty","input":{"values":[]},"expectedStdout":"1\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"one","input":{"values":[7]},"expectedStdout":"1\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"equal","input":{"values":[2,2]},"expectedStdout":"1\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"ordered","input":{"values":[-2,0,3]},"expectedStdout":"1\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"inversion","input":{"values":[1,3,2,4]},"expectedStdout":"0\n","expectedExitCode":0}],"rewardRef":{"id":"reward.exercise.first-pass","version":"1.0.0"}},"program":{"id":"program.c.practice-check-nondecreasing","version":"1.0.0","title":"相邻比较与非递减参考","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"subsetRef":{"id":"subset.c.p0","version":"1.0.0"},"inputRef":{"id":"input.c.check-nondecreasing","version":"1.0.0"},"exampleInput":{"values":[1,3,2,4]},"sourceExample":"#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 4;\n    int values[4] = {1, 3, 2, 4};\n    int ordered = 1;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i = i + 1) {\n        if (values[i] > values[i + 1]) {\n            ordered = 0;\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", ordered);\n    return 0;\n}\n","bindings":[{"bindingKey":"param.n","inputKey":"valu